---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import siteConfig from '../config/site.json';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Affiliate Disclosure"
  description={`FTC-compliant affiliate transparency statement for ${siteConfig.siteName}.`}
  canonicalPath="/disclosure/"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <article class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-xs space-y-5 text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p>
        {siteConfig.siteName} is a free, independently operated suite of cost calculators and pricing comparison tools. To keep all calculators free and continuously updated without paywalls, we participate in software partner and affiliate programs (including PartnerStack and vendor-hosted referral programs).
      </p>
      <p>
        When you click on certain links to software tools or cloud infrastructure providers on this site and sign up or make a purchase, we may earn a referral commission at <strong>no additional cost to you</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        Our cost calculations are driven strictly by mathematical formulas and publicly published pricing schedules. Affiliate partnerships never alter the calculated token cost or break-even math displayed in our tools.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
